OL,3,GNEWSAChainsaw artists dazzle crowds
OL,4,Awith their skills
OL,5,
OL,6,FChainsaw artists wowed crowds as
OL,7,Fvisitors flocked to the opening day of
OL,8,Fone of the UK's largest forestry shows.
OL,10,FThe APF International Forestry Machine
OL,11,FExhibition returned to Ragley Hall,
OL,12,Fnear Alcester, Warwickshire, on
OL,13,FThursday, drawing spectators eager to
OL,14,Fwatch skilled carvers transform logs
OL,15,Finto intricate sculptures in a matter
OL,16,Fof minutes.
OL,18,FAlongside the popular chainsaw carving
OL,19,Fcompetition, the event featured
OL,20,Ftree-felling demonstrations,
OL,21,Ffence-building displays and the latest
OL,22,Fforestry technology.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
